xt></svg> biz ona mümtaz bir huküm ve ılim verdik - ya'ni fevkal'ade bir nüfuz ve hâkimiyyet ve bir ılm-ü nübüvvet verdik <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"216\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 215.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 52.6 52.6 65.3 65.3 74.3 74.3 81.7 97.6 111.0 111.0 118.6 118.6 131.3 147.0 163.6 163.6 171.0 171.0 180.0 191.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 40.6 131.3 147.0 180.0 191.3 199.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve işte biz muhsinlere böyle ceza veririz. - Sui kasd edenlerden kurtarır, Arzda temkin eder, emrine galip olur, huküm ve ilim veririz. Ya'ni ya muhammed, sana da böyle yapıyoruz. Gelelim Yusüfün bundan sonraki mâcerasına: O, öyle irişti 23.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"294\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 293.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 35.3 35.3 42.0 57.7 57.7 68.3 86.3 93.0 101.3 101.3 108.0 108.0 114.7 130.6 141.7 141.7 157.6 165.7 165.7 183.7 195.0 195.0 201.7 201.7 209.3 225.0 225.0 231.7 231.7 238.6 246.0 254.3 261.0 269.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 42.0 68.3 93.0 114.7 157.6 201.7 238.6 246.0 261.0 269.3 277.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve evinde bulunduğu hanım nefsinden kâm almağa kalktı<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 39.7 48.0 48.0 54.7 59.3 66.7 82.4 82.4 99.0 105.7 105.7 112.4 121.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"